  ],
  "description": "Reopen r-sort-3b-mix read-only. On MB (K Text, V1 Yes/No) by IX_KV (K, V1): Seek = and >= with (a, Empty); = (a, Null) from a current row, then after a NoMatch (= zz, False), reading NoMatch; = (a, Null, 1) with one key too many; <> (a, Null); = (a, Null) with the Missing third key; = (a, x) and = (a, 2) with a non-Boolean text and number. By IX_VK (V1, K): = and >= with (Empty, a), (Empty) alone, (Null) alone. NoMatch and the current ID are read after each. Asks whether Empty converts to False as Null does not, and the order of the 3162 refusal against the operator check, the key count and a conversion failure.",
